# <lang>
#   <zh-CN>`C-anp-P32`（`W-anp-P179`）新增：本工作区固定使用 **npmjs 官方源**。
#     成因（实测）：`npm ci` 会按**当前配置的 registry** 改写 tarball 地址——开发者机的用户级
#     `.npmrc` 若指向 npmmirror 等镜像，lock 里的 `resolved` 也会被改写成镜像地址；
#     而该镜像对 **npm 的 tarball 请求**全部返回 400（元数据请求却正常，且同一 URL 的普通
#     HTTP GET 返 200），导致 `npm ci` 必然失败、`node_modules` 为空。
#     修复分两步：①本文件把工作区 registry 固定为官方源（项目级 .npmrc 覆盖用户级）；
#     ②`package-lock.json` 的 `resolved` 由镜像地址改回官方源（30 处，版本与完整性哈希不变）。
#     若你所在网络访问官方源不稳定，可改成本地镜像——但必须保证该镜像**能正常返回 tarball**，
#     否则按 `W-anp-P139` 口径视为前置缺失，不得静默跳过。</zh-CN>
#   <en>`C-anp-P32` (`W-anp-P179`) addition: this workspace pins the **official npmjs registry**.
#     Cause (measured): `npm ci` rewrites tarball locations according to the **currently configured registry** —
#     if a developer machine's user-level `.npmrc` points at a mirror such as npmmirror, the lock's `resolved`
#     entries are rewritten to that mirror as well; yet that mirror returns **400 for every npm tarball request**
#     (metadata requests succeed, and a plain HTTP GET of the same URL returns 200), so `npm ci` inevitably
#     fails and `node_modules` stays empty.
#     The fix has two parts: 1) this file pins the workspace registry to the official source (a project-level
#     `.npmrc` overrides the user-level one); 2) `package-lock.json`'s `resolved` entries were changed back
#     from mirror URLs to the official source (30 entries; versions and integrity hashes unchanged).
#     If the official registry is unstable on your network, switch to a local mirror — but that mirror must
#     **serve tarballs correctly**, otherwise treat it as a missing prerequisite per the `W-anp-P139`
#     convention and never skip silently.</en>
# </lang>
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
